></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq,P)\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq,P)\\)</span> (partial order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-order.md\">../batch12/58-df-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\\)</span> (infimum predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bad662f9e2c57951\" href=\"?note=bad662f9e2c57951\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-order2-infimum.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-order2-infimum.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10InfimumClosedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10InfimumClosedSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}infimum\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10InfimumClosedSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq,P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall D\\subseteq C\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\\to s\\in C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}infimum\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder10InfimumClosedSubset}_S(C,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PartialOrder}_S(\\leq,P)\\land C\\subseteq P\\land\\forall D\\subseteq C\\;\\forall s\\in P\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2Infimum}_S(s,D,P,\\leq)\\to s\\in C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary inf-closure definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text"